rvice-area page) + GAF + Angi. Their site shows 'PA HIC #897'; GAF shows PA000897 - VERIFY at hicsearch.attorneygeneral.gov. NJ number reads 13V045010000 (not the usual 13VH prefix) - reproduced exactly as displayed, verify separately. Founding year stated only as '30 years ago' so foundedYear left blank. Rating via GAF directory."
